comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-19T11:35:41.867Z",codex-sol,The owner selected unbrained as the fleet commit name and retained the existing noreply address. Verify package checks and reseal affected PM histories.
  "2026-11-19T11:49:12.051Z",codex-sol,The initial dependency setup failed during nested npm installation. A clean npm configuration installed the locked dependency graph and the package checks are being repeated.
  "2026-11-19T11:53:38.383Z",codex-sol,"Local tests, typecheck, tracker health, and changelog checks completed. History redaction verified for 6 items with zero hash mismatches. Historical Git attribution matched per commit after mapping 30 approved-address records to the fleet name. Legacy attribution on another address is recorded as a follow-up because a published mapping would require adding that address to the repository."
